stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Searching: intención validada
    Searching --> OptionSelected: conductor elige espacio
    OptionSelected --> Held: Reservation Service crea retención
    Held --> Expired: vence TTL sin confirmación
    Held --> AwaitingConfirmation: agente presenta precio y condiciones
    AwaitingConfirmation --> Cancelled: conductor rechaza
    AwaitingConfirmation --> PaymentPending: confirmación explícita
    PaymentPending --> Confirmed: PaymentAuthorized
    PaymentPending --> PaymentFailed: PaymentFailed
    PaymentFailed --> AwaitingConfirmation: reintento autorizado
    Confirmed --> Active: llega hora de inicio
    Confirmed --> Cancelled: cancelación válida
    Active --> Completed: finaliza intervalo
    Active --> Extended: extensión disponible y confirmada
    Extended --> Active: nuevo intervalo vigente
    Expired --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Completed --> [*]

    note right of Held
        La retención es temporal y pertenece
        exclusivamente al Reservation Service.
    end note

    note right of AwaitingConfirmation
        El agente debe mostrar espacio, horario,
        precio total y política de cancelación.
    end note
